direction: down
style.fill: "#17181b"
*.style: { font-size: 22; bold: false; fill: "#23252a"; stroke: "#747a85"; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; border-radius: 6 }
(* -> *)[*].style: { stroke: "#fc5b05"; stroke-width: 2; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; font-size: 18 }
decision: Your decision\nChoose the outcome { shape: document }
ready: Get Ready\nTools, account and HTTPS
brief: Init\nEditable portable brief { shape: document }
source: Your repository\nAgent builds + tests { shape: package }
worker: Your Cloudflare account\nApp Worker + owned D1 / R2
visitor: Public site\nUse the published app
decision -> ready: authorise your agent
ready -> brief: private evidence stays local
brief -> source: data, not credentials
source -> worker: exact source\nguarded release
worker -> visitor: published HTTPS routes
